  "description": "Hybrid RAG system combining vector search, knowledge graph (LightRAG), and cross-encoder reranking — with Docling document parsing, visual intelligence (image/table captioning), agentic streaming chat, and inline citations. Powered by Gemini or local Ollama models.",
